              "port": "8000",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "proteins",
                "1",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get specific protein details\n\n**If You Own It:**\n- Status: 200 OK\n- See all details\n\n**If It's Public:**\n- Status: 200 OK\n- See all details\n\n**If Private & Not Yours:**\n- Status: 404 Not Found\n\n**Replace 1 with actual protein ID**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
